<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n56298" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καχλ-άζω</span></b> , also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοχλάζω</span></b>  (q.v.), usu. pres. and impf.,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>plash</i> or
			<i>bubble</i>, of the sound of liquids, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φιάλαν ἀμπέλου καχλάζοισαν δρόσῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>O.</u>
					7.2
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>VA</u>
				3.25
			</span></i>; of the sea, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περὶ πρύμναν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Th.</u>
					761
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				115
			</span></i> (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅσυχα καχλάζοντος αἰγιαλοῖο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					6.12
				</span></i>
			 (imitated by <i><span class="en">
				D.P.
				838
			</span></i>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>An.</u>
				5.20.8
			</span></i>; ofrain, <i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				80
			</span></i>; of boiling water, <i><span class="en">
				Zos.
			</span></i> Alch.<i><span class="en">
				p.109
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				B.
			</span></i> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοχλ</span>-): c. acc. cogn.,
				[<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῦμα] πέριξ ἀφρὸν πολὺν καχλάζον</span>
			<i>frothing forth</i> foam, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hipp.</u>
				1211
			</span></i>: metaph., of exuberant eloquence, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ Πλατωνικὸν νᾶμα . . μεγάλας
					παρασκευὰς καχλάζον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					<u>Dem.</u>
					28
				</span></i>
			:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καχλαίνω</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κᾰ</span>- <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
			</span></i> ll.cc., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κᾱ</span>- by position,
			Theoc.l.c.]</div>
